Every window on the shown desktops in the bar, in place of the focused
window's title (barlist in config.h; 0 keeps the title alone). The focused
window shows its chips (chips.diff) in colour, or its icon and title, and
is underlined in the desktop's colour (chadwmbar.diff). Another window
shows only its directory, greyed, and the icon of an agent waiting on
you, in its colour; or its icon and title in SchemeNorm. A click on a
window focuses it: buttonpress finds the window under the click and
passes its place to focuswin (tab.diff), which config.h binds to Button1
on ClkWinTitle. Applies after chips.diff.

